  "predeclared_qualification": {
    "macro_materiality": "For a paired family-control comparison over Q9-Q20, compute per-seed differences in the mean absolute inflation miss and mean positive employment shortfall. At least one metric must have absolute mean paired difference >=0.10 percentage point pooled across the three seeds, with the same nonzero direction in all three paired seeds. Report each seed and the Q1-Q8/Q9-Q20/full20 periods separately.",
    "coupled_bank_consequence": "For the same action/control pair, require a non-noise banking consequence beyond 1e-9: all-in equity sign/crossing differs, or Q20 queue/principal/interest-payable differs, or actual Q20 maturity/repayment changes claim state from Q8 and the paired action produces a non-noise difference. Report raw values and their units; no composite.",
    "fixed_zero_negative_control": "Compare fixed0+current-funding against actual Staff+current-funding per seed on inflation distance, positive job shortfall, cumulative withdrawals paid, terminal queue, minimum and terminal combined equity, interest cost/payables/receivables, terminal principal. Weakly better across all dimensions in every seed is an automatic-recipe rejection. Use 1e-9 native-value tolerance for partial ordering; identify any apparent win whose only macro loss is <0.10pp as near-dominance, not a material tradeoff.",
    "resolution_relevance": "Report Q20 maturity/repayment path versus Q8. If Q9-Q20 is a flat wait without consequential bank or macro choice, or the negative control dominates, stop this lane; preserve negative result."
  },
